    "text": "KUTV\nwebsite\nPine Valley\nPine Valley reopens to public after nearly 2 weeks of fire-related closures\nBy Liv Kelleher, KUTV,\n59 minutes agoPINE VALLEY, Utah (KUTV) — For the first time in nearly two weeks, Pine Valley reopened to the public. As residents and visitors alike returned to the familiar pastures and small-town life of this historic area, they were confronted with the aftermath of the Forsyth Fire, now burning across 13,000 acres and 42% contained.",
